<title>MEXICO: Mexico manufacturers applaud new petrochem stategy.</title>
<headline>Mexico manufacturers applaud new petrochem stategy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's retreat on the privatization of one of its state-run petrochemical units won't scare off foreign investment, the president of the national manufacturers chamber Canacintra said Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;No, in no way at all,&quot; Carlos Gutierrez told reporters in response to whether the government's &quot;new strategy&quot; would scare off foreign investors. &quot;To the contrary, this is the best thing that could have happened in this sense.</p>
</text>
